    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d304">

                <pb facs="0404" n="394" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg394"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/12–847</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister-Counselor of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1147</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-12-08">December 8,
                        1947</date>.<lb/>[Received December 17.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose as of interest
                    a copy of a memorandum of conversation between the Ambassador and Premier Chang
                        <pb facs="0405" n="395" xml:id="pg395"/> Chun regarding the influence of the
                    CC Clique from which it will be noted that Premier Chang Chun claims great
                    credit for the Chen brothers for their early recognition of the Soviet
                    menace.</p>
                <p>It will be noted that Premier Chang is sanguine that when the new constitution is
                    put into effect measures can and will be undertaken which ought to result in
                    improvement of the situation.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis Clark</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d304-a1.xml" xpointer="d304-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
